The parsed catalog in data/datamined/ is a scoped reading of community-parsed game files
(DiabloTools/d4data, branches 3.2 and 3.3_ptr) joined to display names from
josdemmers/Diablo4Companion. The parser code upstream is MIT. The game numbers and
text are Blizzard's. This repository stores that scoped parse beside the hand-entered
catalog. It does not redistribute the raw d4data checkout.
